mage Dataset for Thyroid Nodule Detection and Classification, Scientific Data, 2025.\n \n [2] Huan Zhang, Qianglin Liu, Xiaolin Han, Lijuan Niu, and Weidong Sun. TN5000: An Ultrasound Image Dataset for Thyroid Nodule Detection and Classification, figshare https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.28455641, 2025."}]}